Placeholder so this directory is tracked while it is still empty.

The plan for this tree is to replace report/assets/*.png with figures
generated through the Snakemake DAG: one plot_<name>.py script per figure,
each taking --output <path> and writing exactly that path, with shared style
in _figcommon.py. The Snakefile's `figure` rule already points here and
tests/test_report_build.py already checks the script-versus-registry
invariant in both directions; both are inert only because FIGURES is empty.

Delete this file once the first script lands.
